Subject: Response to Notice of Violation – Associate Certification Exam – September 26, 2026
Dear Guidewire Exam Conduct Review Committee,
I am writing in response to the Notice of Violation dated October 2, 2026, regarding my Associate Certification – InsuranceSuite Developer Proctored Exam conducted on September 26, 2026.
I respectfully request that the Committee consider the circumstances surrounding the incident and review the available proctoring evidence in its entirety before finalizing its findings and proposed remedial actions.
