I understand that the examination rules required me to remain alone in the room, and I sincerely regret that this unexpected charging issue resulted in another person briefly entering the examination environment.
I respectfully request that the Committee review the complete proctoring recording and consider the actual circumstances, duration, and purpose of the person's presence. I also respectfully request that the Committee distinguish the brief charging-related intervention from any conclusion that the individual provided assistance with examination answers.
I do not know the name or identifying details of the security personnel, as I had only seen him outside the room and had no prior interaction or familiarity with him. If required, I am willing to provide any information I can recall that may help identify him.
I understand the seriousness of Guidewire's examination integrity requirements and sincerely regret the situation that occurred. I respectfully request that these circumstances and my cooperation with the review be considered when determining the appropriate remedial action.
In particular, I respectfully request reconsideration of the proposed prohibition of up to five years from Guidewire training, examinations, certifications, and other Education services, and ask that a lesser remedial action be considered.
Thank you for taking the time to consider my response.
Sincerely,
